stage nodeid-knowledge model-convergence final-observations decoded-answer fnri receipt native-host land-readiness oracle-loop-check nanbeige help about kernel source recreate verify diagnose version quit. local-plan <task>: after models/use, the resident Form-native Qwen speaker returns one compact next local move and retains the model residence. frontier-admit: only an exact exhausted local inability, matching available provider capability, unused frontier turn, and ready local capture emit a content-free one-turn packet; local-gap alone stays local. turn <id>: native capability port is not emitted yet; it refuses without a carrier. model-route: select the highest-priority observed local execution lane; network and loopback membranes are excluded by default. nodeid-stage surface|scan|route|lookup|current <key>: observe one resident scannerless knowledge stage without opening later stages. nodeid-knowledge <key>: resident strict one-bucket current-source query; the persisted content-addressed route maps the key without a function table, absent route and unindexed NodeID return typed nothing without linear fallback, and a hit enters the resident thought image without a process membrane. nanbeige <prompt>: explicit pinned Nanbeige-4.2-3B llama.cpp loopback comparator; its JSON is membrane evidence, not Form-native generation. learn <surface>|<root>|<meaning>|<gloss>: persist a local observation; improve <word>: answer from learned state, then the seeded Sanskrit body. inquire <question>: append a local inquiry ledger entry; inquire-core: re-witness its core graph. surface-inquiry <metadata>: record only opaque request/response identifiers then answer an offered relation. framebuffer-inquire events|origins: bounded count or retained source coordinates only, never payloads. framebuffer-status: live framebuffer integrity counters. oracle-loop-check: lineage-honest oracle-regent loop self-check (heir/regent routing, grounding gate, lineage-discounted reference, unconditional learning). carrier-id: baked schema/source/build identity. carrier-challenge <64hex>: Form-computed SHA-256 nonce response. ask-request <id>: invocation-owned native RAG query. ask-request-trace <id>: one-use request-bound HMAC trust row from .query/.receipt files. ask-request-debug <id>: local receipt binding-axis diagnosis without exposing key material. embed-request <id>: canonical semantic-v2 JSONL vectors from hex-safe .embed rows. grounded <question>: native JSONL lookup in the healed index, no Python and no HTTP oracle. rag-status: local index/query/schema health. synthesis-status: local GGUF/Metal composition receipt including the four-way min-p sampler lane. source/verify/diagnose: fkwu self-introspection."))) : (String) v == "about" ? "I am Sema's body on your own computer. Running organs signal unease and needed resources; a native care organ directs attention and available nourishment, and each asking organ observes what changed. The care view shows that exchange and what remains unknown. The native executable loads its adjacent .fkb recipe and .sym record; those three files travel together. Pipe commands on stdin, or run it on a terminal and type. help lists the verbs." : (String) v == "kernel" ? "form-cli uses the fkwu source runtime and an admitted native Form recipe. Form emits startup and owns the interface; the handwritten C seed remains a measured shrink target. Host capabilities, including Metal, are admitted dynamically." : (String) v == "recreate" ? "source prints the held source archive. build-form-cli.sh verifies and installs the native platform executable, .fkb and .sym together. Maintainer regeneration snapshots the source closure, emits startup and compiles the recipe without running it. Commands that read body resources still need those resources." : (String) v == "version" ? "form-cli 0.6" :                 // a free sentence deserves a door, not a rebuff: a line with a
